00:00.000 --> 00:06.159
NEWSFLASH!

00:00.909 --> 00:01.992
Newsflash!

00:01.992 --> 00:03.742
Everybody's here!

00:02.076 --> 00:06.159
EVERYBODY'S HERE!

00:03.742 --> 00:04.909
Are the lights on?

00:04.909 --> 00:06.159
Are you sitting back from the TV?

00:06.367 --> 00:07.951
Let's do this!

00:14.784 --> 00:17.159
You have nowhere to run to, evil women!

00:18.284 --> 00:19.951
