00:19.951 --> 00:21.576
Let's do it, everyone!

00:21.576 --> 00:23.284
CHARM UP!

00:24.867 --> 00:26.534
Damn, these things!

00:30.284 --> 00:31.951
Dammit!

00:31.951 --> 00:35.201
Oh, no! They're so tight,
it's like they're stuck to our skin!

00:35.201 --> 00:36.867
It's no use! I don't have enough power!

00:39.451 --> 00:43.409
As you wanted, I have prepared
the finest of roles for you.

00:53.326 --> 00:54.742
Help me!

00:55.159 --> 00:58.242
It's so cold! I can't breathe!

00:59.201 --> 01:02.326
Ooizumi! Ooizumi!

01:12.201 --> 01:13.117
A dream.

01:13.701 --> 01:17.784
