02:55.326 --> 02:58.117
DAYS OF LOVE AND REMINISCENCES

02:58.117 --> 03:00.284
WAITING ROOM
"STAFF ONLY!"

03:11.534 --> 03:15.076
I'm the only one they called in for pickups.

03:11.535 --> 03:15.076
What lousy luck.

03:20.826 --> 03:23.159
It's like I've been rejected.

03:24.451 --> 03:26.326
By a guy with no taste!

03:30.076 --> 03:34.242
I started in this business early, playing kid roles.

03:34.242 --> 03:37.076
So maybe that's why I'm so
stand-offish with everyone.

03:37.659 --> 03:40.159
But he's different.

03:40.909 --> 03:44.034
I connect with him, equally. Naturally.

03:44.534 --> 03:47.951
C'mon, Sayaka! Cheer up! This isn't like you!

03:52.451 --> 03:55.159
You're right. I just have to do my best.

03:59.326 --> 04:01.034
Ooizumi!

04:01.034 --> 04:03.909
You really are a nice guy, aren't you?!

04:03.909 --> 04:06.076
What?! Quit it!

04:07.326 --> 04:13.076
I was ready to go down fighting, and to be
honest, I didn't think I had a chance!

04:13.951 --> 04:17.117
And then you went and did it!

04:25.076 --> 04:28.076
When I forgot myself and
let my manly side come out,

04:28.076 --> 04:31.201
I instead got complimented
and told it was great!

04:33.117 --> 04:37.034
I was brought up with six brothers,

04:37.034 --> 04:40.159
so I'm actually kind of mannish at heart.

04:40.409 --> 04:44.492
I developed a complex about it
and usually play all innocent,

04:44.492 --> 04:46.451
but thanks to you, I've finally broken free of that!

04:50.659 --> 04:52.867
I really appreciate it.

04:53.867 --> 04:55.909
I look forward to more!

04:57.867 --> 04:59.409
Okay?

05:02.951 --> 05:05.701
Something seems off today.

05:16.826 --> 05:17.576
Katsuragi.

05:19.326 --> 05:21.367
Oh, no. You heard me.

05:21.367 --> 05:22.784
Practicing?

05:22.784 --> 05:27.034
Since all I do is act, I can't sing
as well as the others.

05:27.659 --> 05:32.242
Still, it's strange... I had a feeling you'd come.

05:36.409 --> 05:37.992
I'm sorry.

05:38.826 --> 05:41.326
I'm ashamed of myself.

05:42.367 --> 05:45.576
I was taught a lesson by an elementary schooler.

05:50.284 --> 05:50.992
Thanks.

05:51.742 --> 05:54.367
You did mine, so we're even, now.

05:56.201 --> 05:59.867
To be honest, I was wondering if they'd
take it a little easier on me.

05:59.867 --> 06:02.409
Kind of a naive thing to think, huh?

06:03.701 --> 06:09.909
Still, this is the sort of road everyone
has to cross if they want to be an actor.

06:10.909 --> 06:14.451
Kurume told me that when
she was just starting out,

06:14.451 --> 06:16.992
and wanted people to know
she could act seriously,

06:16.992 --> 06:19.992
she went after the really hard roles.

06:20.576 --> 06:24.409
She said doing that got
her a lot of recognition.

06:26.867 --> 06:29.034
I was impatient.

06:29.034 --> 06:33.951
And my family was telling me

06:29.035 --> 06:33.951
to quit acting and come home.

06:34.659 --> 06:38.117
The condition for me to go on with my career...

06:38.117 --> 06:40.659
was if I could get recognition
as the star of this show.

06:41.409 --> 06:45.784
That's why I started out resolving
to do the best job I could.

06:46.201 --> 06:50.201
You wrote that scene as
encouragement for me, didn't you?

06:52.492 --> 06:56.201
I knew that you're the show's creator.

06:56.992 --> 07:00.492
That's why I was intentionally
trying to get your attention.

07:01.742 --> 07:04.867
I tried coordinating my panties with my napkin.

07:05.201 --> 07:08.034
And intentionally let you see it to tempt you.

07:08.576 --> 07:11.742
I acted like I was asking for advice and
and then threw myself at you, naked.

07:11.742 --> 07:13.034
It was all planned.

07:15.659 --> 07:17.576
All because I wanted a bigger role.

07:18.492 --> 07:22.867
You're angry, aren't you?

07:18.493 --> 07:22.867
You think I'm awful, don't you?

07:30.701 --> 07:34.951
You can do what you like to me,
if that would make you feel better.

07:34.951 --> 07:37.951
Don't be ridiculous! What are you saying?!

07:45.492 --> 07:49.034
If we were both guys,

07:45.493 --> 07:49.034
I guess you could just hit me...

07:49.034 --> 07:52.409
and then we could just go back
to the way we were the next day.

07:54.159 --> 07:56.534
I guess that would be too easy.

07:58.826 --> 08:01.576
You may never forgive me.

08:01.576 --> 08:04.492
My part might get smaller, but...

08:04.492 --> 08:08.701
But I'll keep fighting till the end.

08:04.493 --> 08:08.701
I'll give it all I've got.

08:09.534 --> 08:12.701
Besides, I had a breakthrough, recently.

08:13.201 --> 08:17.201
I am Scarlet. I love Lord Cruce.

08:17.409 --> 08:20.076
Love? What is true love?

08:29.242 --> 08:33.867
In the end, they declared that take
too adult and cut it.

08:33.867 --> 08:35.742
I don't mind, because everyone said...

08:35.742 --> 08:38.284
how much I shone in it, and I was glad for that.

08:38.992 --> 08:42.492
I understand now. It's not a question of the role,

08:42.492 --> 08:44.826
but how I play the role.

08:44.951 --> 08:47.742
It was all thanks to the impetus you gave me.

08:48.867 --> 08:51.284
I may not like how these
wounds haven't gone away,

08:51.284 --> 08:54.909
but I'll use them to remind
myself of what I learned.

08:54.909 --> 08:56.201
Thank you.

08:56.201 --> 08:57.742
Katsuragi...

08:57.742 --> 09:02.451
It might be a little late,
but I've really come to love you.

09:03.284 --> 09:05.784
I'm sorry. That's shameless, isn't it?

09:09.242 --> 09:11.492
Should I really just leave it like this?

09:15.534 --> 09:18.534
Am I really happy about what I've done?

09:20.784 --> 09:22.492
Yes?

09:34.784 --> 09:39.326
There was something I had to
speak with you about after shooting,

09:39.326 --> 09:42.909
but they told me that you'd
left while it was going on.

09:44.326 --> 09:46.326
Did I come too late?

09:46.492 --> 09:49.284
Um, no! Not at all!

09:49.284 --> 09:52.034
Director Koba complimented me today!

09:52.617 --> 09:57.409
Which is to say, he just said
"Well, I suppose that's all right."

09:57.409 --> 10:00.034
But later, Yazawa told me...

10:00.034 --> 10:03.076
that's the highest praise Koba
ever gives anyone!

10:03.367 --> 10:06.367
R-really? That's great.

10:06.367 --> 10:10.367
This episode's been tough,
with a lot of acting on my own...

10:10.951 --> 10:12.534
It's a little embarrassing.

10:13.576 --> 10:15.659
If I get hurt doing this,

10:15.659 --> 10:18.034
I'll have to cancel my magazine photos shoot.

10:19.992 --> 10:23.076
To be honest, there were times
during the show...

10:23.076 --> 10:25.534
where I thought I was ready to quit.

10:25.534 --> 10:29.034
But I kept telling myself that
I had to do my absolute best.

10:30.159 --> 10:31.909
Because I was so happy.

10:33.367 --> 10:37.159
You gave me such a harsh story,
to tell me to keep at it!

10:38.451 --> 10:41.534
I'm sorry. I knew all along.

10:41.534 --> 10:43.992
That you're the show's creator.

10:44.742 --> 10:47.492
I knew, and I tricked you.

10:47.867 --> 10:48.742
Yagami!

10:48.742 --> 10:51.701
You always gave me advice!

10:51.701 --> 10:54.534
When it felt like I was going to snap,
you gave me encouragement!

10:54.534 --> 10:57.534
You were always the first
to compliment my acting!

10:58.326 --> 11:00.701
You were always so kind to me, but...!

11:00.701 --> 11:04.951
But all I've done is lie to you!

11:05.742 --> 11:09.159
But...! But... That time...

11:09.992 --> 11:12.284
That moment was real.

11:13.534 --> 11:16.117
Yes, it started out as an act...

11:16.867 --> 11:21.159
But, each time we met, I saw your good points...

11:21.159 --> 11:23.326
and it just grew from there.

11:23.742 --> 11:26.867
Each time, you made
my heart throb a little more.

11:27.867 --> 11:30.617
Is that why you cried that time?

11:33.117 --> 11:39.409
I told myself "Yeah, I'll get him to do it,
to get what I want."

11:40.076 --> 11:43.076
I told myself not to take it seriously.

11:43.076 --> 11:44.701
But...

11:44.701 --> 11:49.784
But I couldn't help falling in love with you,

11:49.784 --> 11:51.951
and I couldn't go through with it!

11:51.951 --> 11:53.326
Yagami...

11:54.242 --> 11:57.826
I'll keep trying! I'll try to shine!

11:57.826 --> 12:01.117
And then I'll go after you again!

12:01.117 --> 12:03.451
Until then...! No, wait...

12:03.451 --> 12:07.534
If you fall in love with someone else
in the meantime...

12:07.534 --> 12:10.909
and you reject me, there'll be nothing I can do.

12:10.909 --> 12:13.742
I don't deserve you as I am now.

12:19.742 --> 12:21.284
I'm going.

12:21.284 --> 12:24.617
Sorry for barging in on you like this.

12:25.201 --> 12:26.159
I... I'll see you out!

12:29.034 --> 12:31.659
See you at school tomorrow.

